{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you a PuyoPuyo fan or simply a lover of arcade puzzles? Dive into the colorful world of Mayo Mayo, inspired by fast food, sauces and condiments. Play with Blue, Mustard, Mayo, Wasabi, and Ketchup in this Match-4 puzzle that will challenge your reflexes and wits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAIN FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master a variety of combos for explosive chains</strong> and powerful attacks in this <strong>puzzle Match-4</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover 4 game modes designed for all types of players:</strong> Puzzle, Training, Survival and Multiplayer. Whether you\u2019re a seasoned competitor or a newcomer looking to explore the game at your own pace, everyone will find their groove.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge your friends or players from around the world, either locally or online.</strong> Enjoy matches with up to 4 players at the same time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalize your profile</strong> and unlock a collection of both cute and wacky avatars.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228550/extras/e72a41a00556fd6d955f8faa3332f00c.poster.avif?t=1772727693\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228550/extras/e72a41a00556fd6d955f8faa3332f00c.webm?t=1772727693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228550/extras/e72a41a00556fd6d955f8faa3332f00c.mp4?t=1772727693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the Puzzle mode, pull off spectacular combos. Sharpen your thinking and reaction skills through 160 progressively challenging levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228550/extras/02f58b4c011cd3c55884e2d9665e186e.poster.avif?t=1772727693\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228550/extras/02f58b4c011cd3c55884e2d9665e186e.webm?t=1772727693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228550/extras/02f58b4c011cd3c55884e2d9665e186e.mp4?t=1772727693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into Multiplayer mode, locally or online, with friends or players from around the world. Create public or private games with up to 4 players. Plus, you can challenge AI opponents of all skill levels to improve, but be warned\u2014they won\u2019t go easy on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228550/extras/05ad66ec00f9219dbd24e459333e5286.poster.avif?t=1772727693\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228550/extras/05ad66ec00f9219dbd24e459333e5286.webm?t=1772727693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228550/extras/05ad66ec00f9219dbd24e459333e5286.mp4?t=1772727693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love breaking records? The Survival mode, with its 3 difficulty levels, offers an endless experience to push your limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228550/extras/f9ba354462efebf1f760ba24a79120b0.poster.avif?t=1772727693\" width=616 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228550/extras/f9ba354462efebf1f760ba24a79120b0.webm?t=1772727693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228550/extras/f9ba354462efebf1f760ba24a79120b0.mp4?t=1772727693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training mode lets you tweak various settings to hone your skills. Take your time to master this game\u2014easy to pick up, but hard to master!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3228550?t=1772727693","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228550/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772727693","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228550/61ae82d191734af50e7d557a2370cffc99b91c94/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772727693","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228550/61ae82d191734af50e7d557a2370cffc99b91c94/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772727693","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3271510,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragra